      "source_quote": "大通二年，魏郢州刺史元願達請降，高祖敕郢州刺史元樹往迎願達，夔亦自楚城會之，遂留鎮焉。",
      "reading": "元願達請降，元樹往迎，夏侯夔至而留鎮。梁武紀明繫大通二年四月辛丑。",
      "note": "元願達請降，元樹往迎，夏侯夔至而留鎮。梁武紀明繫大通二年四月辛丑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence3-43",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "詔改魏郢州爲北司州，以夔爲刺史，兼督司州。",
      "reading": "改魏郢州為北司州，夔為刺史並督司州。",
      "note": "改魏郢州為北司州，夔為刺史並督司州。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 64,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence3-64",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "三年，遷使持節，進號仁威將軍，封保城縣侯，邑一千五百戶。",
      "reading": "三年進仁威將軍，封保城縣侯。這裡保留本傳「三年」表示。",
      "note": "三年進仁威將軍，封保城縣侯。這裡保留本傳「三年」表示。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 64,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence3-92",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "中大通二年，徵爲右衛將軍，丁所生母憂去職。",
      "reading": "中大通二年徵右衛將軍，因所生母喪去職；未載母名。",
      "note": "中大通二年徵右衛將軍，因所生母喪去職；未載母名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 92,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "時魏南兗州刺史劉明以譙城入附，詔遣鎮北將軍元樹帥軍應接，起夔爲雲麾將軍，隨機北討。",
      "reading": "劉明以譙城歸附，遣元樹迎，夔復起北討。",
      "note": "劉明以譙城歸附，遣元樹迎，夔復起北討。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "尋授使持節、督南豫州諸軍事、南豫州刺史。",
      "reading": "受使持節、南豫州刺史。",
      "note": "受使持節、南豫州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 61,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-61",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "六年，轉使持節、督豫淮陳潁建霍義七州諸軍事、豫州刺史。",
      "reading": "六年轉豫州刺史。南史明書中大通六年。",
      "note": "六年轉豫州刺史。南史明書中大通六年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 61,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "豫州積歲寇戎，人頗失業，夔乃帥軍人于蒼陵立堰，溉田千餘頃。",
      "reading": "在蒼陵立堰灌田。",
      "note": "在蒼陵立堰灌田。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 117,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-117",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "歲收穀百餘萬石，以充儲備，兼贍貧人，境內賴之。",
      "reading": "所收兼贍貧民。",
      "note": "所收兼贍貧民。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 117,
      "end_codepoint": 140,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-140",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "夔兄亶先經此任，至是夔又居焉。",
      "reading": "其兄亶先任此州。",
      "note": "其兄亶先任此州。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 140,
      "end_codepoint": 155,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-155",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "兄弟並有恩惠於鄉里，百姓歌之曰：「我之有州，頻仍夏侯；前兄後弟，布政優優。」",
      "reading": "鄉里歌以兄弟相繼。",
      "note": "鄉里歌以兄弟相繼。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 155,
      "end_codepoint": 193,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-193",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "在州七年，甚有聲績，遠近多附之。",
      "reading": "在州七年屬傳中總稱。",
      "note": "在州七年屬傳中總稱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 193,
      "end_codepoint": 209,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-209",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "有部曲萬人，馬二千匹，並服習精強，爲當時之盛。",
      "reading": "載部曲、馬匹及軍隊訓練。",
      "note": "載部曲、馬匹及軍隊訓練。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 209,
      "end_codepoint": 232,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-232",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "性奢豪，後房伎妾曳羅縠飾金翠者亦有百數。",
      "reading": "傳述後房裝飾與人數。",
      "note": "傳述後房裝飾與人數。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 232,
      "end_codepoint": 252,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:received_sentence4-252",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "zz1_0tr_xni_B",
      "source_quote": "愛好人士，不以貴勢自高，文武賓客常滿坐，時亦以此稱之。",
      "reading": "傳述夔對士人及文武賓客。",
      "note": "傳述夔對士人及文武賓客。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-xiahoukui-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 252,
